# CivilSiteMitra SPA fallback (Netlify / Cloudflare Pages).
#
# The frontend is a client-routed React app: any unknown path must be served
# index.html so React Router can resolve it. Without this rule, opening a deep
# link such as /terms-and-conditions or /sites/:id directly (or refreshing the
# page) returns Netlify's 404 instead of the app.
#
# Assets are excluded because real files under /assets/* must win.
